  "body": "Combining the timeless appeal of traditional character with a stylish contemporary twist, this beautifully presented three-bedroom residence offers charm, comfort and modern functionality across two thoughtfully designed levels.\r\n\r\nFeaturing brick construction on the lower level and solid cement stucco over hardwood framing above, the home showcases enduring character and quality craftsmanship. Beautifully polished dark hardwood floors add warmth and richness to the interiors, complementing the home's contemporary finishes.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a generous bespoke kitchen, expertly designed with quality appliances and ample storage. The kitchen flows seamlessly through to the dining area and separate living spaces, creating an inviting layout ideal for both everyday living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nLarge French doors open effortlessly to a private, sunny north-facing courtyard with well-maintained gardens, providing the perfect space to relax, entertain or simply enjoy all that the home has to offer.\r\n\r\nThe home features three well-appointed bedrooms, two modern bathrooms and excellent storage throughout. The generous main bedroom, positioned on the ground floor, offers a private retreat complete with a spacious ensuite, walk-in wardrobe and direct access to its own private deck.\r\n\r\nA double carport, fully fenced grounds and secure electric gates provide convenience, privacy and peace of mind.\r\n\r\nLocated in one of Kohimarama's most desirable positions, this tightly held and highly sought-after location is an easy walk to Madills Farm, Kohimarama Beach, local cafes and everyday amenities.\r\n\r\nOffering an exceptional blend of traditional charm and contemporary design, this beautifully appointed home delivers effortless, easy-care living with the comfort, style and functionality to accommodate today's busy lifestyles.",
